WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.565
The Moon, casting it.

00:02.335 --> 00:07.748
Behind the Moon, the Earth, and on it the dark spot where the Moon's shadow is touching the ground.

00:08.373 --> 00:14.238
The side of the Moon facing you is in full sunlight, which is why the side facing the Earth is dark.
